#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/graph_validation_and_execution.md:91
msgid "The repository ships no example GraphIR file. JSON and YAML input are supported: a `.yaml` or `.yml` suffix selects YAML, and any other suffix JSON. JSON Schema validation is opt-in through `validate_schema=True` or the `RELIC_GRAPH_SCHEMA_VALIDATE` environment variable. YAML loading raises `RuntimeError` when PyYAML is unavailable. Malformed files propagate JSON, YAML, schema, type, or value errors. `save_graph()` writes JSON."
msgstr "仓库未提供示例 GraphIR 文件。输入支持 JSON 和 YAML：`.yaml` 或 `.yml` 后缀选择 YAML，其他后缀选择 JSON。JSON Schema 验证需通过 `validate_schema=True` 或环境变量 `RELIC_GRAPH_SCHEMA_VALIDATE` 显式启用。PyYAML 不可用时，加载 YAML 抛出 `RuntimeError`。格式错误的文件传播 JSON、YAML、模式、类型或值错误。`save_graph()` 写出 JSON。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/graph_validation_and_execution.md:99
msgid "`SSOTCatalog`"
msgstr "`SSOTCatalog`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/graph_validation_and_execution.md:101
msgid "`SSOTCatalog` resolves variable semantics from the Single Source of Truth (SSOT) parameter database and variable contracts."
msgstr "`SSOTCatalog` 从单点事实源（Single Source of Truth, SSOT）参数数据库与变量契约中解析变量语义。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/graph_validation_and_execution.md:115
msgid "`SSOTCatalog.from_parameter_manager(manager=None)` loads, from the supplied `UnifiedParameterManager` or the global manager when omitted, the variable definitions (`coupling.external.variables.variable_definitions`), the scale defaults (`coupling.scales.defaults.variables`), the variable contracts of `ContractRegistry` with their aliases, and the optional alias table `coupling.external.variables.aliases`. Missing required SSOT payloads raise an exception. The catalog does not collect conflicts: loading raises `ValueError` when a variable is declared twice with contradicting fields, when two variables claim one Climate and Forecast (CF) identity (`standard_name` plus `cell_methods`), when an alias names another variable, is claimed by two variables, or targets an unknown variable, and when the contract registry reports conflicts. `get(name)` looks up a variable name, then an explicit alias, then the unqualified standard name. `get_by_standard_name(standard_name, *, cell_methods=None)` returns the one entry that holds that identity, or `None`. In the example, `entry` is `air_temperature` and `daily_max` is `air_temperature_max` (its alias `daily_maximum_air_temperature` resolves to it), both in K."
msgstr "`SSOTCatalog.from_parameter_manager(manager=None)` 从传入的 `UnifiedParameterManager`（省略时使用全局管理器）加载变量定义（`coupling.external.variables.variable_definitions`）、尺度默认配置（`coupling.scales.defaults.variables`）、`ContractRegistry` 中的变量契约及其别名，以及可选别名表 `coupling.external.variables.aliases`。缺失必需的 SSOT 载荷时直接抛出异常。目录不累积冲突，遇到以下任一情形均在加载阶段抛出 `ValueError`：同一变量重复声明且字段矛盾；两个变量声明同一气候与预报（Climate and Forecast, CF）标识（`standard_name` 加 `cell_methods`）；别名与既有变量同名、被两个变量同时占用或指向未知变量；或者契约注册表报告冲突。`get(name)` 依次按变量名、显式别名与未限定标准名查找。`get_by_standard_name(standard_name, *, cell_methods=None)` 返回持有该标识的唯一条目，未命中时返回 `None`。示例中，`entry` 解析为 `air_temperature`，`daily_max` 解析为 `air_temperature_max`（由其别名 `daily_maximum_air_temperature` 映射而来），两者单位均为 K。"

