#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/graph_validation_and_execution.md:314
msgid "When `auto_adapt=True`, `compile_graph()` records insertions in `plan.report.adapter_insertions` and automatically lowers only `unit_cast` insertions that satisfy all three guard conditions in `relic\\orchestration\\compiler.py`:"
msgstr "当 `auto_adapt=True` 时，`compile_graph()` 会将插入记录写入 `plan.report.adapter_insertions`，且仅对同时满足 `relic\\orchestration\\compiler.py` 中全部三项守卫条件的 `unit_cast` 插入项执行自动降级："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/graph_validation_and_execution.md:318
msgid "**Pure context-free unit contract**: only `unit_cast` is eligible, neither endpoint port declares `context_requirements`, all non-unit port contract fields match (`semantics`, `per_timestep`, `conservative`, and strict `can_connect` after substituting `target.units`), and `UnitConverter.convert` succeeds with `context=None`."
msgstr "**纯无上下文单位契约**：仅 `unit_cast` 符合资格，两端端口均未声明 `context_requirements`，除单位外的全部端口契约字段完全一致（包括 `semantics`、`per_timestep`、`conservative`，以及代入 `target.units` 后的严格 `can_connect` 判定），且 `UnitConverter.convert` 在 `context=None` 条件下换算成功。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/graph_validation_and_execution.md:323
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Matching explicit `execution_group` on non-`State:` endpoints**: the source node is not a declarative `State:` boundary, both endpoint nodes declare an explicit `execution_group` in `{\"fast\", \"medium\", \"slow\"}`, and both groups are equal."
msgstr "**非 `State:` 端点具备相同的显式 `execution_group`**：源节点不属于声明式 `State:` 边界节点，两端节点均在 `{\"fast\", \"medium\", \"slow\"}` 范围内显式声明了 `execution_group`，且两者的执行组完全相同。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/graph_validation_and_execution.md:327
msgid "**Distinct source and target port names**: `source_port` and `target_port` differ so single-writer state ownership is preserved without overwriting the upstream variable."
msgstr "**源端口与目标端口名称不同**：`source_port` 与 `target_port` 互不相同，从而维持单写者状态归属权并避免覆盖上游状态变量。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/graph_validation_and_execution.md:331
msgid "Any other adapter type, cross-group link, context-dependent conversion, or same-name port pair raises `ValueError` during automatic lowering and must be inserted explicitly as a graph node."
msgstr "其余任何适配器类型、跨执行组连接、依赖上下文的转换或同名端口对，均会在自动降级阶段抛出 `ValueError`，必须作为显式图节点手动插入。"

