#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/graph_validation_and_execution.md:381
msgid "Execution first requires the strict compile-run witness, so a plan compiled without `strict=True` is refused. It then resets and initializes the state manager, creates the dependency resolver and a fresh simulator, resolves every plan step to a Functor, registers each Functor, advances `n_steps`, and returns the final managed state. Unknown or unimportable classes, invalid Functor construction, state-contract errors, and runtime execution errors are propagated."
msgstr "执行首先要求严格的编译-运行见证，因此未使用 `strict=True` 编译的计划会被拒绝。随后它重置并初始化状态管理器，创建依赖解析器和一个新的模拟器，将每个计划步骤解析为 Functor，注册每个 Functor，推进 `n_steps`，并返回最终受管状态。未知或无法导入的类、无效的 Functor 构造、状态契约错误以及运行时执行错误都会向外传播。"

